        <title>GD32 GPIO — 调试口复用为 GPIO</title>
        <link>https://clingyang.github.io/p/gd32-gpio-%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95%E5%8F%A3%E5%A4%8D%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%BA-gpio/</link>
